**/node_modules
# Keep .claude/skills tracked — they are graded deliverables (HW05 §7 Agent Skill).
# Only personal/local Claude Code state is ignored.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/.credentials.json
**/.claude/shell-snapshots/
**/.claude/history/
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/dist
**/build
**/database.sqlite
**/logs/

# JMeter local noise. The graded raw logs are committed compressed as
# perf/results/jtl/*.jtl.gz — no rule here matches .jtl.gz, so those track
# normally. The uncompressed .jtl (regenerated by run-scenario.sh) is never
# committed: this repo is shared across the group and the uncompressed Stress
# log alone is ~90 MB. §11's raw-log requirement is met by the .jtl.gz plus the
# `gunzip` step documented in reports/run-manifest.md. The HTML report folders
# under perf/results/html/ are likewise not matched by any rule below and track
# normally. The four JMeter run (.log) files for the graded scenarios are
# explicitly un-ignored below so the manifest's BindException claim is
# checkable from the repo; every other *.log under perf/results/ stays ignored.
jmeter.log
perf/**/jmeter.log
perf/results/**/*.log
!perf/results/jtl/23127300_Load_20260814.log
!perf/results/jtl/23127300_Stress_20260814.log
!perf/results/jtl/23127300_Spike_20260814.log
!perf/results/jtl/23127300_Endurance_20260814.log
# Scratch runs that are not one of the graded scenarios.
perf/results/_scratch/

# sut.sh runtime state — regenerated on every start, not a deliverable.
perf/results/.sut.pid
perf/results/.sut.log

# Scratch materials for recording demo videos — not a submission deliverable.
/demo-scratch/
